taccent Zdotbelow G_tilde.loclGUA Y.loclGUA Yacute.loclGUA Ycircumflex.loclGUA Ydieresis.loclGUA Ydotbelow.loclGUA Ygrave.loclGUA Yhookabove.loclGUA Ymacron.loclGUA Ytilde.loclGUA Cacute.loclPLK Nacute.loclPLK Oacute.loclPLK Sacute.loclPLK Zacute.loclPLK A.ss01 Aacute.ss01 Abreve.ss01 Abreveacute.ss01 Abrevedotbelow.ss01 Abrevegrave.ss01 Abrevehookabove.ss01 Abrevetilde.ss01 Acaron.ss01 Acircumflex.ss01 Acircumflexacute.ss01 Acircumflexdotbelow.ss01 Acircumflexgrave.ss01 Acircumflexhookabove.ss01 Acircumflextilde.ss01 Adblgrave.ss01 Adieresis.ss01 Adotbelow.ss01 Agrave.ss01 Ahookabove.ss01 Ainvertedbreve.ss01 Amacron.ss01 Aogonek.ss01 Aring.ss01 Aringacute.ss01 Atilde.ss01 G.ss01 Gacute.ss01 Gbreve.ss01 Gcaron.ss01 Gcircumflex.ss01 Gcommaaccent.ss01 Gdotaccent.ss01 R.ss01 Racute.ss01 Rcaron.ss01 Rcommaaccent.ss01 Rdblgrave.ss01 Rdotbelow.ss01 Rinvertedbreve.ss01 Delta Omega
